            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:seven-choices:1",
            "text": "In the age of digital saturation (饱和), the need for a digital clean has become more pressing than ever. Like physical space, our digital space also requires a timely clean. The following guide aims to provide you with some practical and effective strategies."
          },
          {
            "textId": "seven-completed:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:seven-choices:4",
            "text": "accounts. Understand your digital footprint and identify areas that require attention. This assessment sets the stage for a targeted and efficient clean. Besides, it ensures that nothing is left unexamined."
          },
          {
            "textId": "seven-completed:6",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:seven-choices:6",
            "text": "The email inbox is often a breeding ground (滋生地) for digital mess. Create folders to organize important emails and cancel outdated messages. It not only reduces visual mess but also enhances your efficiency in managing critical communications. Then you can enjoy a stress-free email experience."
          },
          {
            "textId": "seven-completed:7",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:seven-choices:7",
            "text": "Use social media mindfully."
          },
          {
            "textId": "seven-completed:10",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:seven-choices:10",
            "text": "As you clean your digital space, take a moment to reflect on your habits. Consider the impact of your online activities on your mental well-being. Are there specific digital habits that contribute to stress or distraction? Use this reflection to make informed decisions about adjusting your digital habits for a healthier and more balanced digital lifestyle."
          }
